/E (Research has shown that refuge spaces can reduce stress and allow patients to feel in control of their surroundings. The design is filled with examples of refuge, from individual rooms to shared sunrooms and gathering spaces to central spaces with light courtyards. For example, the shared sunroom features operable sunshades that block outside views and increase the sense of refuge \(Nestor, 2017\).)
