335 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 967 0 R
/E (Outdoor space must be provided on each floor of the RHA and must be fenced. The outdoor space must not be more than 61 meters \(200 feet\) from the farthest resident bedroom. Enclosed outdoor space railings/fences/gates must be at least 1.6 meters \(5 feet\) in height.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
336 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 968 0 R
/E (Landscaping and design of outdoor spaces must take into account the safety needs of residents. Outdoor spaces accessible to residents should include hard, flat surfaces and should not include slopes and steps. Each outdoor space must have areas that provide shade, seating, and protection from wind and other weather elements.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
337 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 969 0 R
/E (Corridors in all residential areas must be at least 1820 mm \(72 inches\) wide. Sturdy handrails must be installed on both sides of the corridor walls. Handrails shall be installed at a minimum height of 860 mm \(34 inches\) above the floor.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
338 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 970 0 R
